---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Shared Capacity Cut | QuotientForge Studio</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <nav><a href={`${base}shared-slot-verifier/`}>Shared-Slot Verifier</a></nav>
      <header>
        <p class="badge">SYNTHETIC DEMO ONLY</p>
        <h1>Four places.<br /><em>Only one reachable.</em></h1>
        <p>Capacity matters where the receivers can use it.</p>
      </header>
      <section aria-labelledby="proof">
        <h2 id="proof">Check the capacity witness</h2>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Logical slot</th><th scope="col">Public capacity</th><th scope="col">Eligible receivers</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">0</th><td>1</td><td>A, B</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">1</th><td>0</td><td>A, B</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">2</th><td>3</td><td>Neither: deadline was slot 1</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <dl>
          <dt>Witness actions</dt><dd>A and B</dd>
          <dt>Exact neighborhood</dt><dd>Slots 0 and 1</dd>
          <dt>Needed vs reachable</dt><dd>2 &gt; 1 + 0</dd>
        </dl>
        <p><strong>Insufficient reachable capacity.</strong> No schedule, even with foresight, meets both deadlines.</p>
      </section>
      <footer>Logical slots only. This is a finite capacity proof, not a real-network measurement.</footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  :root { --paper: #f3f4e8; --ink: #242d1f; --accent: #405726; --rule: #b6bba0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); font-family: Georgia, serif;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 0%, #d3debd, transparent 65%), var(--paper);
    min-height: 100vh; }
  main { width: min(60rem, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin: auto; padding: 1.5rem 0 2rem; }
  nav, footer, .badge, dt, th { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; }
  nav, footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: .65rem 0; }
  a, em { color: var(--accent); }
  .badge { border: 1px solid var(--accent); width: fit-content; padding: .3rem .55rem; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 9vw, 7rem); line-height: .91; margin: .5rem 0; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #fafaf2; }
  td, th { padding: .5rem; border: 1px solid var(--rule); text-align: left; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  dl { border-left: .35rem solid var(--accent); padding: .5rem .8rem; background: #e0e4d2; }
  dd { margin: .12rem 0 .65rem; }
  footer { margin-top: 1.8rem; }
</style>
